Comment: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,MAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我有個小禮物給妳們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,注意腳下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得是在這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎來到我珍藏的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,遙乃的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在燈塔的地下？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,俗話說燈下黑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,開個玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真是沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,燈塔下面居然會有地下室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像電影一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,據說原本這裡是偷偷加建的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,還要妳們幫忙打掃 不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不用謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密基地 秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,請問 為什麼寶木同學妳會有地下室的鑰匙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是海果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,居然注意到了這點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是海果 很敏銳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我爺爺以前是這座燈塔的管理員
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,燈塔廢棄之後
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我和爺爺就把這裡當成是秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,經常在這裡玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不小心弄丟了鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,最近就沒怎麼來過這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天開始就又能隨時在基地裡玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 想玩就來玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,幽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,鑰匙給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,給我？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽到幽妳住在燈塔裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就一直擔心妳住得怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以請自由使用這個房間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,遙乃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,今後就把這裡當做我們的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,三個人的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這原本就是遙乃的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再說讓我獨佔也太浪費了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡承載著妳的回憶 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是妳能經常過來玩 我會很開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,妳說的對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次作戰會議
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,明天是週六
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我們抓緊時間去採購吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,採購？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說要一起出門嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我們已經用了很多材料了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,膠帶剩得不多了 要補充一些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,然後 尾翼這次想用硬一點的塑料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,還有？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想嚐嚐珍珠奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠 奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 珍奶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們明天十點見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要出門囉 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐妳那頑固的卷髮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,確實要好好打理一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,穗波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳幫我梳理頭髮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐妳很少要我幫妳打理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是要去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,去市區買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonavuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma…Mativuu 寶木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,明明還有十五分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,妳來得真早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯 我剛剛才到的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonavuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我來晚了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mativuu 妳很準時哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mativuu 我也是剛到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我們先去買小型的材料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多塑料瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我們真的能免費拿走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,已經得到店裡的許可了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣明內同學就不用強迫自己喝飲料了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但 但是這些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,合適大小的塑料瓶很難找到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,都好小
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們也要這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,六個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,非…非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,還好是個溫柔的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣我們需要的東西都集齊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,任務完成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來呢 接下來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,說的也是 既然還有時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去玩囉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是大頭貼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,閃閃發光的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次拍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,海果妳怎麼全在邊上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太習慣…拍照片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那下一張就由妳站在中間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我沒…沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,被抓住的外星人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因為海果一直想要逃走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,拍得是不是有點奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再拍一張嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這張就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一張 再拍一張吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想用春季限定樣式並擺好姿勢拍一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,幽好像還想再拍一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠奶茶 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠珍珠奶茶奶茶珍珠奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠珍珠奶茶奶茶啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我還是第一次像這樣和別人一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 可以去文具店看一小會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,海果也來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,下次希望雷門同學也能一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 高…跋…利？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是機器人動畫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小學的時候在學校很流行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,初…初中的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,偷聽到雷門同學說…她很喜歡這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不許擅自偷聽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真帥氣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,火…火箭的設計 用這個怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我為什麼要認真去做水火箭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有興趣的事沒必要去做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,對她們來說也是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只是製造火箭需要我的技術而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯 既然互相之間沒有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣不就好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這種比賽 我馬上就讓它結束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,終於到了一決勝負的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,水火箭製作比賽 開幕啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,流星隊的海果隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,請妳發表一下 現在的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,流星隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我剛剛想出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,請說下妳現在的想法！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我要贏下比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,另一方 瞬同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也請妳發表一下想法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我能回去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,順帶問一下 今早吃了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡怎麼調製味噌湯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,聽人說話！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,麵包跟米飯 喜歡哪個？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,米飯啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們搞的鬧劇 別把我捲進來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,速戰速決吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,比賽前的氣氛鋪墊是非常重要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那我問妳 10天前的早飯吃了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,誒！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,10天前嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,誒 我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢材電波女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,先把規則確認一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可以用兩支火箭比賽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雙方各自發射兩次火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,之後以成績較好的一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,靠最優成績 分出勝負嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,讓塑料瓶造的火箭飛得更遠的一方就能取勝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒理解錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我做先手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,海果好帥氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 來把它擺正吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她們做的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,塗装酷似高拔力鋼MKーⅢ的胸部裝甲…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是錯覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 肯定是湊巧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是湊巧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,3 2 1~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,103米
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒！超過了100米！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是最佳紀錄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,這哪怕是雷門同學也…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的火箭的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一定沒問題的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,飛得更徑直 飛得更遙遠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,讓這份心思 能夠傳達給雷門同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,第二發超過了110米…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這並不是在風向上吃了甜頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,機體的精度 水壓 空氣壓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,均經過了相當嚴謹的調試呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,試射時 我的最遠飛行距離是 107米
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是剛剛的距離
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也算挺理想的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,僅通過手動泵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很難再提高了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她們做的MKーⅢ 還挺厲害的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒 真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哼 別以為這就贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我最後一發火箭 還沒有發射呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就妳們那點記錄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我輕輕鬆鬆就能破掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就靠它了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,誒 怎麼感覺 跟我印象中的水火箭不一樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,水火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們在說什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們造的是水推進火箭吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止使用火藥作為動力源的規矩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,給我衝破天際！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,飛起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到達高度 127米
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 妳投機取巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這是投機取巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,妳違規了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,妳吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只要外殼是塑料 就算用火藥推動的火箭模型 也沒有違規！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:51.80,Upper,,0,0,0,,說回來 3對1也太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,輸掉了 我輸掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.71,Upper,,0,0,0,,而且 妳根本沒飛多遠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這明明是 最後跟雷門同學交流的機會了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:55.35,Upper,,0,0,0,,根本不能算贏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.95,Upper,,0,0,0,,高度也是距離的一種好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,輸了這種比試 就擺出一副世界末日的表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這不就搞得我像一個惡人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我說妳 難得我拿了個好東西給妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不要只看著地下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,妳想說什麼 就說出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,敗犬的嗥叫 我就聽聽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,想說什麼 就說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,無非就是幫忙造火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,提供所需的零件之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這些利己 無聊的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,特意這樣轉彎抹角 比賽也贏不了我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雷 雷門同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要博取我的同情心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妳這樣的指望 我會毅然地粉碎它！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,妳 妳頭上戴的護目鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真…真帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我從初中開始就一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一直想跟妳說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,妳的護目鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好…好…帥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想試戴一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,妳說想要當面說的 就是這些？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.09,0:18:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不來學校了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.51,0:18:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有機會…說給妳聽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我 要是能在學校裡 再次見到妳的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我們下次再比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.47,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,去買點喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,海果？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很有她的風格
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,總感覺忘記了一開始的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也玩得很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我們下次再見吧 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,下次就在學校見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,海果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,給我也買一份
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,還有遙乃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,兩位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,自動販賣機在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真無趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真是無趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,檢查鞋櫃？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬 今天有沒有來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我們去教室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonavuu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,煩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,妳可別誤會了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是因為出席天數不夠才來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,鞋子還是室外鞋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止髒鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經拿抹布擦過了所以沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘記帶室內鞋了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不要老是盯著我看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,光憑妳們的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就算傾盡一生也無法造出能飛往宇宙的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看到妳們的危險動作我就很煩躁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就稍微奉陪一下吧
